{"ref":"BDB, רְאוּבֵנִי","hw":"רְאוּבֵנִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רְאוּבֵנִי</span></big>  <strong>adj. gent.</strong> of foreg.; of individ. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:42\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.42\">1 Ch 11:42a</a>; c. art. as subst. coll. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרֽאוּבֵנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:7\" href=\"/Numbers.26.7\">Nu 26:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:14\" href=\"/Numbers.34.14\">34:14</a> (both P), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:8\" href=\"/Joshua.13.8\">Jos 13:8</a> (D; + <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגָּדִי</span>), <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:33\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.33\">2 K 10:33</a> (+ id. + <span dir=\"rtl\">דַמְנַשִּׁי</span>), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.38\">1 Ch 12:38</a> (van d. H. v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:37\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.37\">37</a>; + <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגָּדִי</span> + <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲצִי שֵׁבֶט מְנַשֶּׁה</span>), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:32\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.32\">26:32</a> (id.); <span dir=\"rtl\">לָרֽאוּבֵנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.6\">1 Ch 5:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.16\">27:16</a>, + <span dir=\"rtl\">וְלַגָּדִי</span> (+ sometimes <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲצִי שֵׁבֶט מ׳</span>) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.12\">Dt 3:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.7\">29:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 1:12\" href=\"/Joshua.1.12\">Jos 1:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:6\" href=\"/Joshua.12.6\">12:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:1\" href=\"/Joshua.22.1\">22:1</a> (all D), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:26\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.26\">1 Ch 5:26</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:43\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.43\">Dt 4:43</a>.)","next":"BDB, ראות","prev":"BDB, רְאוּבֵן"}